# Bilingual UI

Every new user-facing feature on this site must support Chinese and English.

- Chinese is the default when the `locale` cookie is missing.
- The navigation switch sets that cookie and reloads the current page.
- Page chrome, empty states, errors, and known field labels must have both languages.
- Stored free text and dictionary `label_zh` stay as written. Translate the label around them, not the user's own words.
- Prefer the message catalog in `web/lib/i18n.ts`, or a locale branch next to the component when the copy is local to one page.
